nd Google Pay. The methods shown at checkout depend on your country.",null,null,false,277],["faq.q4",15,"In which currency do I pay?",null,null,false,278],["faq.a4",15,"Our prices are in euros and US dollars. Elsewhere we show an estimate in your local currency, and checkout may offer to let you pay in it.",null,null,false,279],["faq.q5",15,"How do I use a discount code?",null,null,false,280],["faq.a5",15,"Enter the code in your cart and click “Apply”. You can use one code per order; automatic discounts are applied for you.",null,null,false,281],["faq.group.shipping",15,"Shipping","Group heading",null,false,282],["faq.q6",15,"Where do you ship?",null,null,false,283],["faq.a6",15,"We ship printed books worldwide.",null,null,false,284],["faq.q7",15,"How long does delivery take?",null,null,false,285],["faq.a7",15,"Our books are printed on demand by our print partner. Printing usually takes {production_days} working days; the delivery time depends on the shipping option you choose and is shown at checkout.","{production_days} follows our print partner's current production times. Keep {placeholders} exactly as written",null,false,286],["faq.q8",15,"How much does shipping cost?",null,null,false,287],["faq.a8",15,"Shipping costs depend on your address and the shipping option you choose, and are shown at checkout before you pay. Orders over {amount} ship free.",null,null,false,288],["faq.q9",15,"Will I have to pay customs duties or import taxes?",null,null,false,289],["faq.a9",15,"Depending on your country, import duties or taxes may apply. These are charged by your local authorities and are the recipient's responsibility.","CONFIRM — client to check the English before translating — may change if VAT is collected at checkout (IOSS)",null,true,290],["faq.q10",15,"How can I track my order?",null,null,false,291],["faq.a10",15,"When your order ships, you'll receive an email — with the tracking number if you chose a tracked shipping option. You'll also find it in your account or via the order link in your confirmation email.",null,null,false,292],["faq.group.ebooks",15,"Ebooks","Group heading",null,false,293],["faq.q11",15,"How do I download my ebook?",null,null,false,294],["faq.a11",15,"After payment you'll receive an email with download links. Your ebooks are also always in your account under “Ebook library”. If you ordered as a guest, use the link in your confirmation email.",null,null,false,295],["faq.q12",15,"Which formats do the ebooks come in?",null,null,false,296],["faq.a12",15,"Every ebook includes EPUB and PDF. EPUB works best on e-readers, tablets and phones; PDF keeps the printed page layout.",null,null,false,297],["faq.q14",15,"How many times can I download an ebook?",null,null,false,298],["faq.a14",15,"You can download each ebook {count} times per format. Need more? Just contact us.","CONFIRM — client to check the English before translating (download limit)",null,true,299],["faq.q15",15,"Can I return an ebook?",null,null,false,300],["faq.a15",15,"Ebooks are delivered immediately. Because you agree to immediate delivery at checkout, the 14-day right of withdrawal no longer applies once the download is available. If a file doesn't work, contact us and we'll help.",null,null,false,301],["faq.group.returns",15,"Returns","Group heading",null,false,302],["faq.q16",15,"Can I return a printed book?",null,null,false,303],["faq.a16",15,"Yes. You can withdraw within 14 days of receiving your book, without giving a reason. See our returns page for how it works.","CONFIRM — client to check the English before translating — draft based on EU consumer law and our print partner's policy; legal check pending",null,true,304],["faq.q17",15,"My book arrived damaged. What now?",null,null,false,305],["faq.a17",15,"Email order@obeliskbooks.com within 14 days of delivery with your order number and photos, and we will send you a free reprint or refund you in full.","CONFIRM — client to check the English before translating — draft based on EU consumer 